  "texts": {
    "preamble": "In Re:- Chandan Santra vs Re: An Application For Bail Under ... on 10 May, 2016 Author: Ashim Kumar Roy Bench: Ashim Kumar Roy 1 20 10.5.2016 p.d. C.R.M. No. 3331 of 2016 In re:- Chandan Santra ... Petitioner.",
    "facts": "The petitioner is in custody for more than 220 days and already investigation is over and although charge sheet has been submitted against 9 accused persons but none of the chargesheeted accuseds are on bail. It is the case of the prosecution that by consuming poisonous I.D. liquor, about 23 persons died and quite a large number of persons became seriously ill. We have been informed by the learned Public Prosecutor that after the accuseds' prayer for discharge under Section 227 Cr.P.C. was turned down, they took adjournment till May 24, 20015, on the ground of moving this Hon'ble Court against such order and therefore, no charge could be framed.",
